main unclear. Police officers Jens and Mike are on routine patrol in Svalegården's ghetto when news of Talib's death comes in over the radio, igniting uncontrollable, pent-up rage in the ghetto's youth, who lust for revenge. Suddenly, the two officers find themselves fair game and must fight tooth and claw to find a way out."},{"language":"da-DA","title":"Shorta","overview":"Hvad der helt nøjagtigt skete med 19-årige Talib Ben Hassi, mens han var i politiets varetægt, henstår i det uvisse. To betjente, Jens og Mike, er på rutinepatrulje i ghettoen Svalegården, da meddelelsen om Talibs død kommer, og et utæmmeligt raseri hos de unge fører til oprør og et krav om hævn. Pludselig er de to betjente blevet jaget vildt og må slås for deres liv for at komme ud."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9qtIRZInREoIp61Ndtgkuy0QPC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rVttzFfjuFABzVoafvUxwuGtgV8.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":711017,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"da-DA","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9qtIRZInREoIp61Ndtgkuy0QPC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j9qtIRZInREoIp61Ndtgkuy0QPC.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j9qtIRZInREoIp61Ndtgkuy0QPC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j9qtIRZInREoIp61Ndtgkuy0QPC.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg","language":"en","width":1707,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9At4gHXspTVG89nUZBJNM5zGmHm.jpg","previewUrl"